questions.question_text:
Each grid square is $1$ unit.
Which arrow represents a unit vector?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[help lines] (0,0) grid (5,4);
\draw[->,thick] (0,1) -- (3,1) node[midway,below] {$\underset{\sim}{a}$};
\draw[->,thick] (4,0) -- (4,1) node[midway,right] {$\underset{\sim}{b}$};
\draw[->,thick] (1,3) -- (3,3) node[midway,above] {$\underset{\sim}{c}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
